OlivineCity_Interior4_Text_Fisher_1::
	.string "OLIVINE is on the sea!\p"
	.string "And if it’s on the sea, there are\n"
	.string "bound to be fish!\p"
	.string "I’ve fished here for 30 years.$"

OlivineCity_Interior4_Text_Fisher_2::
	.string "Would you like to face the sea and\n"
	.string "fish?$"

OlivineCity_Interior4_Text_Fisher_3::
	.string "Whaaat? You don’t like to fish!?\n"
	.string "Incomprehensible!$"

OlivineCity_Interior4_Text_Fisher_4::
	.string "How are things?\n"
	.string "Land the big one?$"

OlivineCity_Interior4_Text_Fisher_5::
	.string "Ah, hahah!\n"
	.string "We have ourselves a new angler!$"

OlivineCity_Interior4_Text_Fisher_6::
	.string "Fish aren’t found in the sea alone.\n"
	.string "They go wherever there is water.$"
